            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EComprehensive WCAG 2.1 accessibility auditing for Umbraco backoffice. 37 checks across Level A, AA, and AAA with scored results, scan history, site-wide audits, printable reports, and CSV export. Lightweight with no external dependencies \u2014 works on Umbraco Cloud and all hosting environments out of the box.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/digitalwonderlab.accessibilitytoolkit\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
